  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">9R in Aqaba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalyzing a transformative model for circularity through 9R`s in Aqaba.As circular economy activities are becoming more formalized, the 9Rs framework for implementing these activities is considered as a new innovative, comprehensive approach that concentrates on smarter product use and manufacture (reuse, rethink, reduce), extending lifespan of product and its parts (reuse, repair, refurbish, remanufacture, repurpose), and useful applications of materials (recycle and recovery).</narrative>
  </description>
